# The Student Learning Buddy prompt is verified byte-for-byte against the
# SHA-256 in its MANIFEST.json (backend/tests/studyHelp.skillSync.test.js),
# which is computed over LF line endings. Without this, a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the file to CRLF and the check fails.
ai-skills/**/UNIVERSAL_SYSTEM_PROMPT.txt text eol=lf
